        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e6d10fb-fdf7-4013-bf57-db2290b911b5).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Dubai, 47.\r\rWe have been hired by Messrs. Fanculitta, Kazemi, and Marevick to eliminate each other. Once upon a time, the three comprised an elite private black ops outfit, however, things fell apart after a mission went awry when their targets were found alive weeks later, thanks to our old friend Klaus&apos; resurrection shenanigans.\r\rEach blames another of the group for the disintegration of their organization, which means triple the payday.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
